{"seq":6,"slug":"public-policy","title":"公共政策","stage":"DONE","category":"political-science","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy","rating":{"composite":4.2,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"公共政策\">公共政策</h1><p>政府决定修建哪条地铁、如何征税、怎样应对疫情、是否补贴新能源——这些影响千百万人生活的决定，都是公共政策。本知识库以<strong>政策过程</strong>为主线，系统讲解政府&quot;做什么、为什么这样做、效果如何&quot;：从一个问题如何被注意、被定义，到方案如何设计、如何拍板、如何落地，再到如何评估成败、为何常常失败。它既是政治学的重要分支，也是一门面向实践、力图改善公共决策的应用学科。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 的定位：与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>公共政策与政治学其他议题高度交叉，但各有侧重。<strong>本 hub 聚焦&quot;政策作为一个过程如何运转&quot;这条分析主线</strong>，下表说明它与相邻 hub 的边界，帮助你按需取用、避免重复阅读：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>关注的核心问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>本 hub（公共政策）</strong></td>\n<td>政策从议程到评估的<strong>全过程</strong>如何运转，为何失败</td>\n<td>主线：过程视角、分析框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../political-systems-governance/\">政治体制与治理</a></td>\n<td>政府的<strong>制度与机构</strong>如何组织（官僚制、治理理论、电子政务）</td>\n<td>提供政策运行的制度容器；本 hub 讲过程，它讲结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../power-legitimacy/\">权力与合法性</a></td>\n<td>权力如何运作、政府凭什么获得<strong>服从</strong></td>\n<td>解释议程设置与决策背后的权力逻辑、政策成效与合法性的关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../democracy-authoritarianism/\">民主与威权</a></td>\n<td>不同<strong>政体</strong>如何做集体决策</td>\n<td>提供政策过程所处的政体背景（协商、民粹、数字威权等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../political-economy/market-economy-capital/state-market/\">国家与市场（政治经济学）</a></td>\n<td>政府与市场如何<strong>互相塑造</strong>的结构性逻辑</td>\n<td>深化对政策背后利益与分配的理解</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：想知道<strong>政府由什么部门、什么制度构成</strong>，去&quot;政治体制与治理&quot;；想知道<strong>一项政策是怎样一步步被做出来又为何走样</strong>，留在这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>零基础公民 / 通识读者</strong>：按章顺序通读即可。先读 <a href=\"foundations/what-is-public-policy\">什么是公共政策</a> 与 <a href=\"foundations/policy-cycle\">政策周期</a> 建立总框架，再沿议程→决策→评估→困境走完全程；重点体会第五章&quot;政策为何常常失败&quot;，它最能改变你看待政府的方式。</p>\n<p><strong>政策 / 公共管理方向的学生</strong>：在通读基础上，重点深读三处易被低估的环节——<a href=\"agenda-and-formulation/problem-definition\">问题界定</a>（政策的政治性在此最深）、<a href=\"decision-and-implementation/implementation\">政策执行</a>（好政策败于此）、<a href=\"evaluation-and-tools/evaluation\">政策评估</a> 与 <a href=\"evaluation-and-tools/evidence-based\">循证决策</a>（因果推断是方法硬核）。</p>\n<p><strong>实务工作者 / 决策参与者</strong>：可问题导向地跳读。关心&quot;怎么把事做成&quot;看第三、四章（<a href=\"decision-and-implementation/decision-constraints\">决策的现实约束</a>、<a href=\"evaluation-and-tools/policy-instruments\">政策工具</a>）；关心&quot;为什么总是事与愿违&quot;直接看第五章（<a href=\"challenges-and-significance/policy-failure\">政策失败与非预期后果</a>、<a href=\"challenges-and-significance/wicked-problems\">棘手问题</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub<strong>无需专业背景</strong>，但具备以下基础会理解得更深：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对政治过程的基本感知</strong>：知道政府由不同部门构成、决策涉及多方博弈即可；想补这块结构性背景，可先看 <a href=\"../political-systems-governance/\">政治体制与治理</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>一点统计直觉</strong>：第四章评估与循证部分涉及因果推断，了解 <a href=\"../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/hypothesis-testing/testing-fundamentals\">假设检验</a> 的基本思想会读得更顺，但不懂也不影响把握主旨。</li>\n<li><strong>基础经济学概念</strong>：财政、激励、博弈等概念在决策与工具章节反复出现，<a href=\"../../economics-finance/economics-thinking/macroeconomics/fiscal-policy\">财政政策</a> 等可作补充，非必需。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本知识库，你将既掌握分析公共政策全过程的核心框架与概念，也对政府治理之复杂、之艰难、之意义，形成一种务实而清醒的认识。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"公共政策的基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-public-policy","title":"什么是公共政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/foundations/what-is-public-policy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-science-perspectives","title":"政策科学与研究视角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/foundations/policy-science-perspectives"},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-cycle","title":"政策周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/foundations/policy-cycle"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"agenda-and-formulation","title":"议程设置与政策形成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/agenda-and-formulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agenda-setting","title":"议程设置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/agenda-and-formulation/agenda-setting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"problem-definition","title":"问题界定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/agenda-and-formulation/problem-definition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-formulation","title":"政策形成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/agenda-and-formulation/policy-formulation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-and-implementation","title":"政策决策与执行","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/decision-and-implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"decision-models","title":"政策决策的模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/decision-and-implementation/decision-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"decision-constraints","title":"决策的现实约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/decision-and-implementation/decision-constraints"},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation","title":"政策执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/decision-and-implementation/implementation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation-and-tools","title":"政策评估与政策工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/evaluation-and-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evaluation","title":"政策评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/evaluation-and-tools/evaluation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-instruments","title":"政策工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/evaluation-and-tools/policy-instruments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evidence-based","title":"循证决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/evaluation-and-tools/evidence-based"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"challenges-and-significance","title":"政策的困境、挑战与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/challenges-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"policy-failure","title":"政策失败与非预期后果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/challenges-and-significance/policy-failure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wicked-problems","title":"棘手问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/challenges-and-significance/wicked-problems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-challenges","title":"当代治理的新挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/challenges-and-significance/modern-challenges"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"公共政策的意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/public-policy/challenges-and-significance/significance"}]}]}